# absolute rules for sway web

## 1. NO EMOJIS - EVER
- never use emojis in code, comments, documentation, commits, or any output
- use text alternatives: [deployed], [warning], [done], [failed]

## 2. LOWERCASE COMMENTS
- all comments in lowercase across all languages

## 3. NO HARDCODED SECRETS - CRITICAL
- never commit api keys, passwords, tokens to git
- never hardcode secrets in source code
- .env files are gitignored and never committed

## 4. CLOUDFLARE WORKER SECURITY
- use wrangler secrets for all sensitive data
- validate all inputs
- implement rate limiting
- use proper cors configuration

## 5. DEPLOYMENT
- deploy via: wrangler deploy
- verify secrets: wrangler secret list
- test after deployment

